# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, which would rewrite the working copy
# to CRLF on checkout. GitHub Pages reads CNAME literally and tools/test_site.py
# asserts LF, so pin every text file the site is built from to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
CNAME text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
